<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 599.15, up 1.05.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 277 to 272.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,020,840 compared with 20,756,520 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
